Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:58:33 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] FitCheck-In Sync: upload Apple Workout Effort with
 workouts (iOS 18+)

Reads workoutEffortScore (user-rated) or estimatedWorkoutEffortScore for each
workout's time range so the server can rate strength sessions by effort
instead of heart rate, which under-reads lifting.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
